ith the painting activities, you can draw…"],["Sabai Motorbike and Jeep Adventures","activity",13.37301,103.86587,"","","","","","r","Explore the Cambodian countryside on a guided motorbike adventure or in a Jeep. On tour, get off the beaten path to discover authentic, rugged, and fascinating Cambodia. Sabai Moto and Jeep Adventures tours start from Siem Reap."],["L'Angelo","restaurant",13.3773,103.8613,"","","","","","r","Probably Siem Reap's most daring restaurant, serving fusionesque Italian cuisine like foie gras on a bed of white asparagus and balsamic vinegar ice cream in a setting so achingly modern that the only decoration is a cloud of black dots…"],["Cafe D’Angkor (Raffles Grand Hotel D’Angkor)","restaurant",13.3644,103.86,"","","","","","r","This restaurant is inside the colonial-era Raffles Hotel. Main courses include western and Khmer dishes, and range from US$20-30. Both the food and services were excellent. There are other restaurants in this hotel."]]}